\\ pass.6502 - the pass's start: every second frame (D8), as the beam leaves the screen, and the keys taken. In
\\ main RAM.

\\ Wait for the pass's frame to start, as the beam leaves the screen: FramesPerPass after the last pass's, or
\\ the next frame's if the last ran late, so every pass starts at line 192. Then take the keys.
\\
\\ Inputs:
\\     passframe: the frame this pass may start at
\\
\\ Outputs:
\\     passframe: the next pass's
\\     A: the keys down at any frame since the last pass (GameKeys' bits), Z from it
\\     keys: emptied
\\     X: 0
\\     Y: preserved

.wait_pass
{
    ZA_AUTO1 passframe                  ; in, out: the frame the pass may start at

    LDX irqframes:CPX passframe:BMI ontime  ; (mod 256: negative while it's to come)
    INX:STX passframe                   ; late: from the next frame's start instead
.ontime
    LDA passframe
.wait
    CMP irqframes:BNE wait
    ADC #FramesPerPass-1:STA passframe  ; (C set: equal)
    LDX #0:LDA keys:STX keys            ; (no SEI: the IRQ's just been, the next a frame off)
    RTS
}
